ant the riots to  be able to happen because we think maybe  they actually will stop the  certification of the election  we don't know the answer to that yet but  every week we are getting more and more  information about the fact that many  people and by people we mean elected  officials  associates of trump  and law enforcement had reason to fear  that this was going to get really really  bad on january 6 and it did  and the right preparations were not  ultimately in place at some point we may  know the full story we still don't know  it as of right now

